<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch bourse suspends Fokker trade.</title>
<headline>Dutch bourse suspends Fokker trade.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Amsterdam Stock Exchange said on Thursday it was suspending trade in Fokker shares and convertible bonds until further notice.</p>
<p>&quot;Trade...is suspended in connection with an expected statement,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>Fokker has been negotiating with South Korea's Samsung Aerospace to take over the bankrupt Dutch aircraft-maker.</p>
<p>Earlier this week Dutch television said the South Korean governemt was expected to decide on Thursday whether to give its blessing for the takeover.</p>
</text>
